# ta_messaging

[![Documentation](https://docs.taf.ute.nsn-rdnet.net/projects/ta_messaging/badge/)][1]
[![Requirements](https://taf.wrgitlab-pages.int.net.nokia.com/miscellaneous/static-badges/requirements.svg)](requirements/base.txt)
[![build status](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/abstract_library/ta_messaging/badges/main/pipeline.svg)][2]
[![coverage report](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/abstract_library/ta_messaging/badges/main/coverage.svg)][2]
[![latest release](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/abstract_library/ta_messaging/-/badges/release.svg)][3]

Catching and parsing messages, awaiting flows, extracting message fields  
- LTE Messages handling (based on tshark of wts)  
  https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/abstract_library/ta_messaging/wikis/messaging-examples

PLEASE DO NOT COMMIT ANYTHING TO SVN AS RELEASES FROM GIT DEVELOPMENT REPOSITORY WILL OVERWRITE YOUR CHANGES  

## Supported Python versions

Library should work properly with Python versions specified within
`python_requires` option in [setup.py](setup.py).

## Installation

Generic library installation process is described in [TAF user guide][4].

